  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sport, Art and Therapy for 50 children in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides a highly effective 10 week sports and arts programme combined with group therapy to 50 children and youth in conflict with the law in Lusaka, Zambia to improve their mental and physical health and help them reintegrate into society. The programme will focus on reinforcing positive behaviours and reducing anti-social behaviour. 50 parents are also reached through weekly support groups.  A new group of teens and parents will start in June 2023 if funding goals are reached.</narrative>
  </description>
